<!--
  The status-bar icon.

  A notification icon must be a **single-colour silhouette on transparent**: the
  OS takes its alpha channel and tints it, so any colour here is discarded and
  any filled background becomes a solid white block. That is why this is the
  sprout's outline rather than the launcher icon, which has a painted backdrop.

  24dp, which is the density-independent size the platform expects.
-->
